<?php foreach($authorities as $a): ?><details><summary>#<?= h($a['id']) ?> · <?= h($a['side']==='seller'?'Наше юрлицо':'Контрагент') ?> · <?= h($a['signer']) ?> · <?= $a['revoked_at']!==null?'Отозвано':'Не отозвано' ?></summary><p><?= h($a['basis']) ?> · <?= h($a['valid_from']) ?> — <?= h($a['valid_until']) ?> · проверил #<?= h($a['verified_by']) ?> · <?= h(gmdate('Y-m-d H:i:s',(int)$a['verified_at'])) ?> UTC</p><?php if($a['revoked_at']!==null): ?><p>Отзыв: <?= h($a['revoke_reason']) ?> · #<?= h($a['revoked_by']) ?> · <?= h(gmdate('Y-m-d H:i:s',(int)$a['revoked_at'])) ?> UTC</p><?php elseif($owner): ?><form method="post" class="formgrid"><?php $hidden('contract.revoke') ?><input type="hidden" name="authority_id" value="<?= h($a['id']) ?>"><label>Основание отзыва<input name="reason" required maxlength="500"></label><button>Отозвать</button></form><?php endif ?></details><?php endforeach ?></section>
